\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Two-stack pipeline. The generation stack produces frozen conversation histories (run once). The evaluation stack presents each history to the model under test across twenty independent trials per condition. The stacks are decoupled so that evaluation-side variance cannot be contaminated by generation-side randomness.}}{13}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{3.1}{13}{Two-stack pipeline. The generation stack produces frozen conversation histories (run once). The evaluation stack presents each history to the model under test across twenty independent trials per condition. The stacks are decoupled so that evaluation-side variance cannot be contaminated by generation-side randomness}{figure.caption.5}{}}
